  "post_content": "<p>(27 fotos) Moss&egrave;n Jordi Mas Pastor ha pres possessi&oacute; aquest diumenge com a nou p&agrave;rroc de l&#39;Assumpci&oacute; a Onda, c&agrave;rrec on substitueix a <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=88879\" target=\"_blank\">moss&egrave;n Domingo Jos&eacute; Galindo Mat&iacute;as, mort repentinament dissabte 11 de d</a>esembre. La parr&ograve;quia de l&#39;Assumpci&oacute; d&#39;Onda dirigeix tamb&eacute; l&#39;arxiprestat 9, on estan quasi tots els municipis de l&#39;Espad&agrave;-Millars.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120007.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120214.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120214\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120221.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120221\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120246.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120246\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120250.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120259.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120259\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jordiprenpossessioassumpcioonda/img_20220116_120512.jpg\" alt=\"img_20220116_120512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.